WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
This walkthrough demonstrates the Pharos
Policy Gatekeeper.

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.100
Start with a configurable single request
limit, a

3
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.100
recipient allowlist, and a permitted time
window.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.740
These rules determine whether a proposed

5
00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.460
payment can proceed to review.

6
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.130
First, evaluate a request that meets

7
00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.970
every rule and inspect the allow decision.

8
00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.490
Then increase the amount beyond the limit.

9
00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:21.770
The amount rule denies the

10
00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:24.170
request, with the reason recorded.

11
00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:26.500
Next, choose a recipient outside the
allowlist.

12
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:29.260
That request is denied.

13
00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.280
Return to an allowed recipient, then

14
00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.700
test outside the permitted time window.

15
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.360
The time rule denies it.

16
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.120
Explicit approval cannot override these
rules.

17
00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.030
Each decision is saved for inspection.

18
00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:43.550
Single and batch unsigned exports share a

19
00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:46.690
rolling allowance, so repeated exports count
together.

20
00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:50.630
This demonstration produces no signature and
sends no transaction.
